  "description": "Hyunsoo, set to graduate from art school, misses his final nude croquis exam. As a result, his professor, Yujin Song, gives him an F. Desperate, Hyunsoo pleads with Professor Song, who finally allows him to retake the test alone. And the model is Professor Song herself.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/8038), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12210190), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/female_professor_nude_croquis), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5700000011), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000069306), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250242), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=y2tt), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=0vza), Metoon \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish ([Toomics](https://toomics.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), HoneyToon), [S.Chinese](https://toomics.com/sc/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [T.Chinese](https://toomics.com/tc/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [Spanish](https://toomics.com/mx/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [Italian](https://toomics.com/it/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [B.Portuguese](https://toomics.com/por/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [French](https://toomics.com/fr/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [German](https://toomics.com/de/webtoon/episode/toon/8038), [Japanese](https://toomics.com/ja/webtoon/episode/toon/8038)",
